explain (costs off)
select a.idv, b.idv from tidv a, tidv b where a.idv = b.idv;
                        QUERY PLAN                        
----------------------------------------------------------
 Merge Join
   Merge Cond: (a.idv = b.idv)
   ->  Index Only Scan using tidv_idv_idx on tidv a
   ->  Materialize
         ->  Index Only Scan using tidv_idv_idx on tidv b
