               Output: i2.gemini_pk, i2.unique1, i2.unique2, i2.two, i2.four, i2.ten, i2.twenty, i2.hundred, i2.thousand, i2.twothousand, i2.fivethous, i2.tenthous, i2.odd, i2.even, i2.stringu1, i2.stringu2, i2.string4
         ->  Hash
               Output: i1.f1
               ->  Seq Scan on public.int4_tbl i1
                     Output: i1.f1
   ->  Hash
         Output: "*VALUES*".column1
         ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
               Output: "*VALUES*".column1
(16 rows)

---END---
