         Hash Cond: (i1.f1 = i0.f1)
         ->  Nested Loop Left Join
               Output: i1.gemini_pk, i1.f1, i2.gemini_pk, i2.q1, i2.q2, '123'::bigint
               ->  Seq Scan on public.int4_tbl i1
