               ->  Seq Scan on public.int8_tbl i2
                     Output: i2.gemini_pk, i2.q1, i2.q2
                     Filter: (123 = i2.q2)
         ->  Hash
               Output: i0.gemini_pk, i0.f1
               ->  Seq Scan on public.int4_tbl i0
                     Output: i0.gemini_pk, i0.f1
(17 rows)

