   left join int8_tbl t4 on t2.q2 = t4.q2)
on t1.q1 = t2.q1;
           QUERY PLAN           
--------------------------------
 Nested Loop Left Join
   Join Filter: (t1.q1 = q1)
   ->  Seq Scan on int8_tbl t1
   ->  Result
         One-Time Filter: false
(5 rows)

---END---
---START---
-- deduce constant-false from an EquivalenceClass
